  "description": "Beyond the Wall, survival is never guaranteed. In a world where mutation can turn anyone into a monster, Margo and Esther make a living taking on jobs no one else will. Margo fights to keep her hunger under control, while Esther clings to the belief that she was born from love. But as they draw closer to the truth, buried memories begin to surface, and the line between human and monster starts to disappear. Esther was everything Margo had ever loved. But will everything be tested when they finally learn what they are to each other?\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
